---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { catalog } from '../data/catalog';
import { imageUrl, sourceImageUrl } from '../domain/chroma';

const firstChroma = catalog.reduce((lowest, item) => item.rank < lowest.rank ? item : lowest);
const jadeSwordChroma = catalog.find((item) => item.nameZh === '玉剑传说 无极 白虎');

const title = 'What Are LoL China Exclusive Prestige Chromas? | CHROMA ART';
const description = 'Learn what China Exclusive Prestige Chromas are in League of Legends, why they have unique splash arts, and how CHROMA ART tracks new releases.';
const canonical = 'https://chromaart.lol/about/';
const jsonLd = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'AboutPage', name: title, description, url: canonical };
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {canonical} {jsonLd}>
  <article class="about-page" data-language-content="en">
    <p class="kicker">ABOUT THE ARCHIVE</p>
    <h1>What Are China Exclusive Prestige Chromas in League of Legends?</h1>
    <p>China Exclusive Prestige Chromas are League of Legends chroma variants released for Chinese services with their own unique splash arts. They are chromas of existing skins, not traditional Prestige Skins.</p>
    <figure class="about-art">
      <img src={imageUrl(firstChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', firstChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <section>
      <h2>Release Date for the China Exclusive Chroma Splash Arts</h2>
      <p>The Chinese server of "League of Legends" typically updates a new batch of exquisite original artworks to the "Exquisite Collection" during version updates, and the main way to obtain them is through recharge activities.</p>
      {jadeSwordChroma && <figure class="about-art">
        <img src={imageUrl(jadeSwordChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', jadeSwordChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Availability and Release Tracking</h2>
      <p>Availability varies by event and patch on the Chinese League of Legends servers. CHROMA ART records the patch associated with each catalog entry and adds new Prestige Chromas when verified source data becomes available. For current purchase requirements, players should consult the active Chinese server event or store information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How to Get China Exclusive Chroma Splash Arts</h2>
      <p>China Exclusive Prestige Chromas are associated with Chinese League of Legends services and regional promotions. They are not generally listed as standard chromas in the global client. Exact acquisition methods can change between events, so this archive focuses on identifying the chroma, its base skin, patch, category, and unique splash art.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <article class="about-page" data-language-content="zh">
    <p class="kicker">关于图鉴</p>
    <h1>什么是《英雄联盟》中国服务器专属臻彩原画？</h1>
    <p>中国服务器专属臻彩原画是为仅在《英雄联盟》中国服务器提供的英雄皮肤臻彩版本特别制作的独立原画。与沿用现有原画背景或仅作少量调整的普通臻彩不同，这些臻彩拥有完全定制的视觉画面。</p>
    <figure class="about-art">
      <img src={imageUrl(firstChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', firstChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <section>
      <h2>中国服务器专属臻彩原画的发布时间</h2>
      <p>《英雄联盟》中国服务器通常会在版本更新期间，向“臻彩藏品”更新一批精美原创画作，主要获取方式为充值活动。</p>
      {jadeSwordChroma && <figure class="about-art">
        <img src={imageUrl(jadeSwordChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', jadeSwordChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>上架与更新追踪</h2>
      <p>臻彩的上架方式会随中国服务器的活动和版本变化。CHROMA ART 记录每件藏品对应的游戏版本，并在获得可靠数据后更新图鉴；当前获取条件应以中国服务器正在进行的活动或商城信息为准。</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>如何获得中国服务器专属臻彩原画</h2>
      <p>中国独家臻彩与《英雄联盟》中国服务器服务及地区活动相关，通常不会作为普通炫彩出现在全球客户端。具体获取方式可能随活动变化，因此本站重点记录臻彩名称、原皮肤、版本、分类和独立原画。</p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .about-page { width: min(860px, calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter) * 2))); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px) 0 100px; }
    .about-page h1 { font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: .45em 0 .6em; font-weight: 500; }
    .about-page section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 42px; padding-top: 34px; }
    .about-page h2 { font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", serif; color: var(--gold); font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .about-page p:not(.kicker) { color: #c7cad4; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; }
    .about-art { width: 100%; margin: 32px 0 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #090b15; box-shadow: 0 18px 48px #0008; }
    .about-art img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .about-page { padding: 52px 0 72px; }
      .about-page h1 { font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 10vw, 3rem); }
      .about-page section { margin-top: 34px; padding-top: 28px; }
      .about-page p:not(.kicker) { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
